/Title (Welcome back to school! I hope you are all ready for an incredible year of service and leadership. As your Lieutenant Governor, I am so excited to work alongside your clubs to make a lasting impact in our division.To kick off the year successfully, please make sure your club immediately updates all current officers and advisor contact information within the Kiwanis Engage Portal so you never miss vital district announcements. Additionally, remember to add your new and returning members to your official club roster via the Kiwanis International Online Membership Update Center before early bird dues processing opens on October 1st. Keeping our records current and submitting those fall dues on time ensures your club stays in good standing and your members receive their well-deserved benefits.Thank you for your dedication to servant leadership, and please reach out if your board needs any guidance as you plan your first service projects. Let's work together to make this our best year yet!)
